      "summary": "Hit Dice: 1d12 per barbarian level. Hit Points at 1st Level: 12 + your Constitution modifier. Hit Points at Higher Levels: 1d12 (or 7) + your Constitution modifier per barbarian level after 1st. Armor: Light armor, medium armor, shields. Weapons: Simple weapons, martial weapons. Tools: None. Saving Throws: Strength, Constitution. Skills: Choose two from Animal Handling, Athletics, Intimidation, Nature, Perception, and Survival. TomeStack: levels 1-20.",
